        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-1969P, Elite Collection Charlotte Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Charlotte Appliance Pull has a clean look that is well suited to transitional homes. This Elite Collection Charlotte Appliance Handle is available in a wide array of beautiful finish colors including satin nickel and satin brass. Choose from 12 or 18 inch center to center lengths. The Omnia Elite 1969 Appliance Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware to install it on a standard refrigerator panel; but it can be installed on almost any kitchen appliance that has a front panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia AP-1969P pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/charlotte-cabinet-pull-omnia-1969\"><b>Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Charlotte Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-1969P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-1969P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
